      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 11
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 21,
      "Position": "Right",
      "Text": "ذات وحدت، صفات پس افعال",
      "CoupletIndex": 10,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 12
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 22,
      "Position": "Left",
      "Text": "واحد است و عدد ز روی مثال",
      "CoupletIndex": 10,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 12
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 23,
      "Position": "Right",
      "Text": "عشرات و مآت، باز الوف",
      "CoupletIndex": 11,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 13
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 24,
      "Position": "Left",
      "Text": "همچو خط است و سطح و نقش حروف",
      "CoupletIndex": 11,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 13
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 25,
      "Position": "Right",
      "Text": "آن زآحاد وز احد برخاست",
      "CoupletIndex": 12,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 14
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 26,
      "Position": "Left",
      "Text": "وین هم ازنقطه و نُقَط برجاست",
      "CoupletIndex": 12,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 14
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 27,
      "Position": "Right",
      "Text": "همچنین جسم​ها ز سطح و خط است",
      "CoupletIndex": 13,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 15
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 28,
      "Position": "Left",
      "Text": "که مر آن را وجود از نقط است",
      "CoupletIndex": 13,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 15
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 29,
      "Position": "Right",
      "Text": "سه موالید اگرچه از چار است",
      "CoupletIndex": 14,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 16
    },
    {
